{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 37, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of Culture and Wonder\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the bustling streets of Tokyo to the serene gardens of Kyoto, I was struck by the country's unique blend of traditional and modern culture.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the market were overwhelming, with fresh sushi and seafood on display everywhere. I was also fascinated by the ancient temples and shrines that dot the Japanese landscape, such as the Fushimi Inari shrine in Kyoto, famous for its thousands of vermilion torii gates.\n\nJapan's food was another highlight of my trip. I sampled a range of delicious dishes, from sushi and ramen to tempura and yakitori. The attention to detail and care that goes into preparing each meal is truly impressive.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was also struck by the country's strong sense of community and respect for tradition. From the polite bowings and courteous service to the carefully maintained gardens and temples, it's clear that Japan is a country that values its heritage.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a journey of discovery and wonder. With its unique culture, stunning landscapes, and delicious food, Japan is a destination that has something for everyone. Whether you're a foodie, a history buff, or simply looking for a new adventure, Japan is a must-visit destination.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.4752216339111328}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.009767360053956509}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.048598796129226685}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.000526289688423276}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -7.867782187531702e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.036712877452373505}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0